# Adapters

Full map: `src/README.md`.

- `templates.ts` turns `src/theme` exports into `#build/ui/*`, `ui.css`, `ui.static.css`, and `types/ui.d.ts`. Both adapters call `getTemplates`.
- `module.ts`: alias `#ui`, `addPlugin(colors)`, `addComponentsDir`, `addImports`, templates, Tailwind via `vite:extend`.
- `unplugin.ts`: write templates to `node_modules/.nuxt-ui`, alias `#build` and `#imports`. `createViteIntegrations` returns real Vite plugins.
- `vite.ts`: return `[AcharehUIPlugin.vite, ...createViteIntegrations].flat()`. Consumers place `ui()` after `vue()`.
- Component resolvers stay `enforce: 'post'`. Do not return those plugins from `config()`.
- Do not re-export `src/runtime/types` from `module.ts`.
- New `app.config` component keys are added by hand in `appConfigTypes()`.
